{"Abel, the younger, a keeper of sheep. Light tunic and staff.":["d281edf633",5.54],"Cain, the elder, a tiller of the ground. Dark tunic.":["3592fc8e13",5.14],"Eve: “Adam!”":["83497b193e",1.85],"Eve: “Of the fruit of the tree which is in the midst of the garden, God hath said, Ye shall not eat of it, lest ye die.”":["570f838586",8.45],"Serpent: “Ye shall not surely die… ye shall be as gods, knowing good and evil.”":["db0a5d9b43",5.88],"Serpent: “Yea, hath God said, Ye shall not eat of every tree of the garden?”":["6c8aa840a8",5.38],"Voice of the LORD: “In the sweat of thy face shalt thou eat bread, till thou return unto the ground.”":["7c6d438191",6.77],"Voice of the LORD: “Where is Abel thy brother?”":["1fe0a9eaf1",3.19],"Voice of the LORD: “Go forth from the garden of Eden.”":["ec236a01d9",3.79],"Abel is no longer in the garden. From here on, the game continues with Cain.":["102b44e735",6.86],"Abel survived. From here on, the game continues with Abel.":["af1f7625e8",5.78],"Adam and Eve appear once more in the middle of the garden.":["a20f402327",5.45],"Adam and Eve walk away from the field…":["89ae782f8b",4.15],"Adam hesitates… and looks at Eve.":["2d02c92d79",3.74],"Now there are four to find.":["4a5e05aeae",3.12],"Angels descend with the light":["bee4b7815a",3.74],"Cain found Abel.":["b7f5cfae19",2.78],"Cain is looking for Abel.":["d7ec3f9cef",3.26],"Choirs of angels fill the sky of Eden":["b9d2aa3acd",4.42],"God brings Eve to the garden":["e30e10d895",3.7],"God visits Adam":["cca7051156",2.86],"God visits Adam and Eve":["6eacb06488",3.6],"She offers the fruit to Adam.":["90bf65865d",3.31],"Eve looks at the fruit… and hesitates.":["dd376111fa",3.91],"Outside the perfection of the beginning, Adam\\'s family grew.":["7851a584fa",6.46],"In the midst of the garden stood the tree of knowledge of good and evil.":["c8dae3b294",6.0],"The garden, after everything.":["035b116aff",3.34],"Time is up. Cain did not find Abel.":["a11a8e9a81",4.13],"The heavens open over the garden":["0324ac3f48",3.96],"The years went by…":["d80465f165",2.74],"Doves descend with the light upon the garden":["168dd9d3c2",4.61],"A bright light comes down from heaven…":["9fc5f5b37a",3.58],"“Adam knew Eve his wife; and she conceived, and bare Cain… And she again bare his brother Abel.”":["52eefdee82",8.21],"“The LORD God walking in the garden in the cool of the day”":["e9f0dca8d8",5.38],"“And Cain talked with Abel his brother: and it came to pass, when they were in the field…”":["e3f9bd0c7f",6.96],"“Unto Adam also and to his wife did the LORD God make coats of skins, and clothed them.”":["abbe8c02dd",7.85],"“Therefore the LORD God sent him forth from the garden of Eden, to till the ground from whence he was taken.”":["61a12229e7",8.52],"“And Cain went out from the presence of the LORD.”":["137d56c426",4.42],"“And the eyes of them both were opened…”":["7dbd2db36b",3.89],"“This is now bone of my bones”":["44f3511eff",3.74],"“…and gave also unto her husband with her; and he did eat.”":["c39c3e61a6",5.3],"“…and he placed at the east of the garden of Eden Cherubims, and a flaming sword, to keep the way of the tree of life.”":["6ba40f7d5a",9.17],"“…Cain rose up against Abel his brother.”":["66961f2d25",4.22],"“…she took of the fruit thereof.”":["aaa5f8ba3d",3.34],"Cain rejoins the family.":["de406a3249",3.43],"Abel rejoins the family.":["148b90700f",3.36]}